    {
      "id": "88L1kSZTFMmqvc0D-YhBO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 678.8676206756754,
      "y": -34.869617830480706,
      "width": 533.6995849609375,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "az",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 896310189,
      "version": 610,
      "versionNonce": 105618381,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791388438831,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "shortURL creation method:\n1. take the longURL and base62 encode it\n2. take the N (6 here) characters from it\n3. for better randomness, add a salt like redis counter\nor nonce.\n\n(All of it is atomic & concurrency proofed)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "shortURL creation method:\n1. take the longURL and base62 encode it\n2. take the N (6 here) characters from it\n3. for better randomness, add a salt like redis counter\nor nonce.\n\n(All of it is atomic & concurrency proofed)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "AMDvvJP4PTnCUQ_4Krr1F",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -14.538218487174277,
      "y": 718.0319400261633,
      "width": 675.49951171875,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b00",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1002515981,
      "version": 1375,
      "versionNonce": 2141263176,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791389139285,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Estimates\n100M urls/day = 1.1k URLs/s\n\n1 Row size ~ 500Bytes = 500B * 100M = 50 GB for immediate use.\n(slow storage for unused dormant URLs)\n\ncache is LRU + ttl, each cache entry = max 100B,\nwe can store upto top 10k hottest entries per cache node,\nso 100B * 10000 = 1MB, can be increased under load.\neviction is crucial here, or we scale the cache to include more entries.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Estimates\n100M urls/day = 1.1k URLs/s\n\n1 Row size ~ 500Bytes = 500B * 100M = 50 GB for immediate use.\n(slow storage for unused dormant URLs)\n\ncache is LRU + ttl, each cache entry = max 100B,\nwe can store upto top 10k hottest entries per cache node,\nso 100B * 10000 = 1MB, can be increased under load.\neviction is crucial here, or we scale the cache to include more entries.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "B0WW3mRIAXP-5c5E739ev",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1329.7016969333674,
      "y": -85.57874102325502,
      "width": 533.4996337890625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b02",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 537050403,
      "version": 617,
      "versionNonce": 1390746989,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791388735613,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Read/Write replicas = 20 : 1\n(since 100:1 is the ratio, can be easily handled by this)\nShard by PK for load dist. (consistent hashing works)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Read/Write replicas = 20 : 1\n(since 100:1 is the ratio, can be easily handled by this)\nShard by PK for load dist. (consistent hashing works)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GtWnHlBEGZxZhVSnvnW2E",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1832.317948448464,
      "y": 248.55077426686705,
      "width": 483.39971923828125,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b04",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1037953549,
      "version": 609,
      "versionNonce": 1858037997,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791388783272,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Note: \nPG over KV coz we have relational data between \nuser and their urls with metadata",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Note: \nPG over KV coz we have relational data between \nuser and their urls with metadata",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
